---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../../public/images/speakers/toyin-adeleye.png";
---

<section id="meet-your-host" class="woman-excel-host" aria-labelledby="host-heading">
    <div class="woman-excel-host__copy">
        <p class="woman-excel-host__eyebrow">The woman behind the welcome</p>
        <h2 id="host-heading">Meet your<br /><em>host.</em></h2>
        <h3>Pastor Toyin Adeleye</h3>
        <p class="woman-excel-host__role">Host · Woman Excel International Conference</p>
        <p class="woman-excel-host__description">
            <em>Pastor Toyin Adeleye</em> is a visionary minister of the Gospel, dynamic leader,
            gifted worshipper, and passionate intercessor. She is widely recognized for her commitment
            to women’s empowerment, family transformation, and purposeful living, inspiring believers
            to fulfill their God-given destinies and live impactful lives.
        </p>
        <p class="woman-excel-host__description">
            Together with her husband, <em>Pastor Reuben Adeleye</em>, she serves as Co-Pastor of{" "}
            <em>RCCG Cornerstone Assembly, Saskatoon, Saskatchewan, Canada.</em> She is also the visionary
            host of the Woman Excel International Conference, a transformational platform dedicated
            to raising women who excel in every area of life.
        </p>
        <p class="woman-excel-host__description">
            An accomplished entrepreneur and professional, Pastor Toyin holds credentials in
            Project Management, Financial Advisory, and Early Child Care, alongside degrees in
            Statistics and Business Administration. Through her ministry and leadership, she continues
            to empower lives, build families, and raise purpose-driven leaders for global impact.
        </p>
        <a class="woman-excel-host__link" href="/contact">
            Connect with us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
    </div>
    <figure class="woman-excel-host__portrait">
        <span class="woman-excel-host__orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Pastor Toyin Adeleye, host of the Woman Excel International Conference"
            width="1000"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            widths={[320, 640, 960]}
            sizes="(max-width: 760px) 85vw, 480px"
        />
        <figcaption>Faith. Purpose. Sisterhood.</figcaption>
    </figure>
</section>
